  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(MAM)_The project &#x2018;Targeted Supplementary Feeding, Enhanced Community Level Nutrition Surveillance and Social Behavioural Change Communication on Improved Nutrition in Sierra Leone during the Lean Season&#x2019; will target children aged 6-59 months and Pregnant and Lactating Women (PLWs) who have become moderately malnourished with a supplementary food package and Social Behaviour Change Communication. The project aims to avoid and/or delay the progression of undernutrition to Severe Acute Malnutrition</narrative>
  </description>
